{"ref":"BDB, עֲשָׂיָה","hw":"עֲשָׂיָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשָׂיָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Ασαιας, etc.; 𝔊L in Kgs. Αζαριας;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  servant of Josiah <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.12\">2 K 22:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 22:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.22.14\">14</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.20\">2 Ch 34:20</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  Simeonite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.36\">1 Ch 4:36</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Levites: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.15\">6:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.6\">15:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.11\">11</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.5\">9:5</a>.","next":"BDB, (ו)יעשׂו","prev":"BDB, עֲשִׂיאֵל"}